# GENERATED by gen_model_perturbed.py from model_exact.arm: the
# detector's model with identification-sized errors (see the script).
observer 50 0.3 0.01
# motor torque per amp: 1.5 * pole pairs * psi (j1.conf .. j6.conf)
kt 1 1.1112
kt 2 1.1112
kt 3 1.1112
kt 4 0.36
kt 5 0.36
kt 6 0.36
# thresholds: J thr0 [Nm] thr_v [Nm s/rad] thr_s [Nm] vs [rad/s]
# (0: not checked); ~1.5 x the residual floor of model_perturbed.arm
# over tests/inc_motion_suite.txt: moving (thr0), and the stiction band
# near standstill (thr_s, gone by ~2 vs)
thresh 1 14 0 15 0.15
thresh 2 17 0 21 0.15
thresh 3 13 0 18 0.15
thresh 4 2.7 0 2.5 0.15
thresh 5 2.8 0 2 0.15
thresh 6 0.9 0 1.2 0.15
# plus 30 % (J1-J3; 20 % the wrist) of the dynamic torque |tau - g(q)|: inertia errors at full
# acceleration from standstill (LinuxCNC's trapezoidal moves and jogs)
threl 1 0.3
threl 2 0.3
threl 3 0.3
threl 4 0.2
threl 5 0.2
threl 6 0.2
# plus the rotors' acceleration torque: through the elastic gears the
# rotor runs ahead of the link at every jerk (LinuxCNC's trapezoids)
thrrot 1 1
thrrot 2 1
thrrot 3 1
thrrot 4 1
thrrot 5 1
thrrot 6 1
dh 1 0     0    0.45 0
dh 2 0.15 -90   0    -90
dh 3 0.60  0    0    0
dh 4 0.12 -90   0.65 0
dh 5 0     90   0    0
dh 6 0    -90   0.10 180
link 1 36 0.01187 0.013457 -0.084219 1.38 1.38 0.92 0 0 0
link 2 27.5 0.28503 0.011343 0.035994 0.23 1.15 1.15 0 0 0
link 3 13.5 0.061917 0.081044 0.012382 0.46 0.46 0.1725 0 0 0
link 4 5.4 -0.015855 0.015812 0.16355 0.069 0.069 0.023 0 0 0
link 5 3.3 0.012911 0.016442 -0.013277 0.0115 0.0115 0.0115 0 0 0
link 6 1.1 0.014276 -0.017652 0.059139 0.0023 0.0023 0.0023 0 0 0
motor 1 120 0.000385 0.02 8
motor 2 120 0.000385 0.02 8
motor 3 100 0.000385 0.02 8
motor 4 80 3.3e-05 0.01 1.5
motor 5 80 3.3e-05 0.01 1.5
motor 6 50 3.3e-05 0.01 1.5
